+// 6 regions dropped: a member entry changed while decoding ahead, 7 CALL continuations pulled in,
+// 8 successors rejected: not decoded (aot off), 9 blocks ending in a dynamic transfer (RET/indirect/syscall),
+// 10 blocks ending in a direct CALL, 11 successors outside the page window (aot off / user), 12 target
+// page not mapped executable / no frame, 13 block budget full, 14 instruction budget full,
+// 15 successor is a self-looping trace, 16 formation attempts, 17 attempts yielding one block,
+// 18 page budget full, 19 regions with >1 page, 20 pages total, 21 regions dropped by a write
+// (registry), 22 dead-region exits taken at a first execution, 23 first-execution marks,
+// 24 successors rejected as too cold (nanobox_jit_aot_minhot), 25 rejected as already translated (dedupe)
+// 26 region rooted at the containing function instead of the entered block, 27 the entered block was
